type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Optional.  The list of fields ''Apply'' fills in from the moment of
import when the profile does not bind them: any of `created`,
`modified`, `creator`, `modifier`.

```
"stamp": ["created", "modified"]   ← the default when the key is absent
"stamp": []                        ← stamp nothing
"stamp": ["modified", "modifier"]  ← modifier takes $:/status/UserName
```

Rules:

* A field the profile binds is never stamped over.
* Overwriting an existing tiddler never changes its `created` or
  `creator` by stamping; only a bound value does.  `modified` and
  `modifier` are stamped fresh.
* A renamed or added tiddler is new, so its creation fields are fresh.
* Any other name is a `bad-stamp` error.

The editor shows the four as checkboxes under the records path and
writes the key only when the choice differs from the default.
